{
  "description": "“结算”：get_cart 确认有选中商品后调用 checkout（幂等键为本次运行 ID），按店铺拆单；回答带 order_list 块和去订单页的 action 块。无模型的“商品查询 → 加购 → 结算 → 订单查询”闭环的第三步",
  "setup_requests": [
    {
      "as": "blink_user",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/agent/sessions",
      "body": {}
    },
    {
      "as": "blink_user",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/agent/sessions/{setup_session_id}/messages:stream",
      "body": {
        "client_message_id": "fixture-1",
        "content": "推荐一款通勤降噪耳机"
      }
    },
    {
      "as": "blink_user",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/agent/sessions/{setup_session_id}/messages:stream",
      "body": {
        "client_message_id": "fixture-2",
        "content": "把第一个加入购物车"
      }
    }
  ],
  "request": {
    "method": "POST",
    "path": "/api/v1/agent/sessions/{setup_session_id}/messages:stream",
    "as": "blink_user",
    "body": {
      "client_message_id": "fixture-3",
      "content": "结算"
    }
  },
  "response": {
    "status": 200,
    "events": [
      {
        "event": "message_start",
        "data": {
          "message_id": "<message_id>",
          "replayed": false,
          "run_id": "<run_id>",
          "session_id": "<session_id>",
          "trace_id": "<trace_id>"
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "understand",
            "status": "running",
            "title": "理解你的问题"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "understand",
            "status": "done",
            "title": "理解你的问题"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "plan",
            "status": "done",
            "title": "判断需求：结算下单"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "tool-1",
            "status": "running",
            "title": "查看购物车"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "tool-1",
            "status": "done",
            "title": "查看购物车"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "tool-2",
            "status": "running",
            "title": "提交订单"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "thinking",
        "data": {
          "step": {
            "id": "tool-2",
            "status": "done",
            "title": "提交订单"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "text_delta",
        "data": {
          "delta": "已为你生成 1 个订单（按店铺拆单），实付合计 ¥569.05。"
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "text_delta",
        "data": {
          "delta": "<pattern:Blink 数码旗舰店：订单号 BS\\d{20}，待支付，实付 ¥569\\.05，请在 30 分钟内支付，超时会自动关闭。>"
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "text_delta",
        "data": {
          "delta": "说“支付订单”我可以帮你完成（模拟）支付，或者到“我的订单”里操作。"
        }
      },
      {
        "event": "block",
        "data": {
          "block": {
            "orders": [
              {
                "account_id": "acct_seed_user",
                "cancel_reason": "",
